          "startingLine": 586
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Apple",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 29,
          "startingLine": 587
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "OpenStreetMap",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 29,
          "startingLine": 590
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "The OpenStreetMap styles come from volunteer servers; Wattspur loads only the tiles on screen and keeps them for a while. Without a connection the route shows on a plain ground.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 595
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Stop syncing with iCloud?",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 37,
          "startingLine": 631
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Sync with iCloud",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 28,
          "startingLine": 615
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "One library on this iPhone and your Mac, in your own iCloud account.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 34,
          "startingLine": 621
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Without iCloud, the rides stay on this iPhone. They reach the Mac with “Share GPX”, e.g. by AirDrop.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 34,
          "startingLine": 623
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Takes effect the next time Wattspur opens: close it in the app switcher.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 34,
          "startingLine": 626
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Turn Off",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 28,
          "startingLine": 632
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "The rides stay in iCloud, on your Mac and on this iPhone. New rides then stay on this iPhone.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 634
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Import Files …",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 27,
          "startingLine": 644
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "FIT and GPX files, several at once, also from iCloud Drive. Files you put into “On My iPhone › Wattspur › Import” in the Files app are imported when Wattspur opens; then they move to “Importiert”, or to “Fehler” if they cannot be read.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 647
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Rides",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 32,
          "startingLine": 651
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Library",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 653
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Your rides are on this iPhone and in your own iCloud account, the same as on your Mac.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 656
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Your rides are on this iPhone. Sync with the Mac comes with iCloud.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 658
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Restore This Backup?",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 16,
          "startingLine": 732
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Back Up Automatically",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 20,
          "startingLine": 700
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Back Up Library …",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 23,
          "startingLine": 690
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Restore Backup …",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 23,
          "startingLine": 697
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Backup",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 703
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "A backup is a folder with all your rides, bikes, goals and notes, the same as on the Mac. Choose iCloud Drive, On My iPhone or a USB stick. A backup from this iPhone restores on the Mac, and the other way round.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 706
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "The folder for the automatic backup is no longer there. Back up once by hand to choose a new one.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 30,
          "startingLine": 709
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Back up once by hand to choose the folder. After that Wattspur backs up there when it opens and the last backup is older than a week, and keeps the newest three automatic backups.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 30,
          "startingLine": 712
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "When Wattspur opens and the last backup is older than a week, it backs up into the folder you chose last. It keeps the newest three automatic backups there and deletes only its own.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 30,
          "startingLine": 714
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Last backup: %@",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 718
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Restore",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 20,
          "startingLine": 735
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Cancel",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 20,
          "startingLine": 736
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "The backup is from %@ (Wattspur %@).",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 38,
          "startingLine": 780
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "It holds %lld rides.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 45,
          "startingLine": 782
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "The library on this iPhone is replaced with the backup the next time Wattspur opens. Rides and changes since the backup are not in it. The current library is kept in a folder beside it.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 44,
          "startingLine": 784
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Sync with iCloud is on: the rides in iCloud and on all your devices are then replaced with the backup too.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 48,
          "startingLine": 786
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "This backup was made by a newer version of Wattspur. Update Wattspur before you restore it.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 48,
          "startingLine": 789
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Backed Up",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 754
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "“%@” in “%@”",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 755
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Close Wattspur in the app switcher and open it again. It then replaces the library with the backup.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 765
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Ready to Restore",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 23,
          "startingLine": 764
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Cancel Restore",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 24,
          "startingLine": 768
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Some changes from this iPhone are not in iCloud yet. Keep iCloud on for Wattspur until they are, or they may be lost.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 34,
          "startingLine": 808
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Last synced",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 36,
          "startingLine": 813
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "This iPhone is not signed in to iCloud, or iCloud is off for Wattspur. New rides stay only on this iPhone.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 835
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "iCloud is restricted on this iPhone. New rides stay only on this iPhone.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 837
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Your iCloud storage is full. New rides stay on this iPhone until there is room again.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 839
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "No connection to iCloud. Wattspur syncs as soon as there is one again.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 841
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Sync is not working at the moment: %@",
        "location": {
