          "startingColumn": 27,
          "startingLine": 912
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Wattspur has no server and no account. Your rides stay on your devices and in your own iCloud.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 915
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Record Raw Motion",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 24,
          "startingLine": 931
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "For a test of acceleration and lean angle: each recording also writes the motion sensors and GPS into a file. You find it in the Files app under “On My iPhone › Wattspur › Bewegung”. About 20 MB per hour.",
        "location": {
